"The custom HUD shows the per-phase frame times. Fast-forward runs extra console frames per displayed frame and mutes audio while it is active; if presented frames stay below 20 fps the app lowers the speed automatically. The graphics warm-up is optional and off by default: the pipeline cache is still written while you play either way." = "自定义 HUD 显示各阶段帧时间。快进会为每个显示帧额外运行主机帧，启用期间会静音音频；如果呈现帧率持续低于 20 fps，应用会自动降速。图形预热为可选项且默认关闭：无论是否开启，管线缓存都会在游玩过程中写入。";
