"The screen layout is read when a game loads, so a layout change applies to the next load. The presented console layout is the fastest path; other layouts use the screen-readback path. Integer scaling snaps the presented image to whole screen pixels." = "屏幕布局在载入游戏时读取，因此布局修改会在下次载入时生效。主机叠放布局是最快的路径；其他布局使用屏幕回读路径。整数缩放会把呈现画面对齐到整屏幕像素。";
"The screen layout is read when a game loads, so it applies to the next load. The other display changes apply immediately." = "屏幕布局在载入游戏时读取，因此会在下次载入时生效。其他显示修改立即生效。";
"The selected file is empty." = "所选文件为空。";
"The selected file is not a ZIP archive." = "所选文件不是 ZIP 压缩包。";
"The selected file is too large to import." = "所选文件太大，无法导入。";
"The switch is on, but this build must also enable the HUD (MetalHudEnabled in Info.plist), or turn on Developer → Graphics HUD on the device, then relaunch." = "开关已开启，但此构建还必须启用 HUD（Info.plist 中的 MetalHudEnabled），或在设备上打开“设置 → 开发者 → 图形 HUD”，然后重新启动应用。";
"There are too many files to include in one save-data archive." = "文件过多，无法放入一个存档数据压缩包。";
"There is no battery save data to export yet. Save in the game's own menu first." = "还没有电池存档数据可导出。请先在游戏自带的存档菜单中保存。";
"There is no save-state slot %ld." = "没有存档位 %ld。";
"This app ships without any game data. It has no ROMs, decryption keys, system files or game assets. Import only dumps that you made from a console you own." = "本应用不附带任何游戏数据，不包含 ROM、解密密钥、系统文件或游戏资源。请只导入你从自己拥有的主机上导出的数据。";
